@startuml dfd
title CampusNav — Data Flow Diagram 
' Improve readability
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam actorFontSize 18
skinparam noteFontSize 18
skinparam defaultFontColor #111111
skinparam arrowColor #222222
skinparam shadowing false

left to right direction

actor User
rectangle "CampusNav (Client)" as App
cloud "Mapbox" as Mapbox
database "POI Store (local/cache)" as POI
database "Session Store (optional) (Firestore)" as Session
database "Task Store (local/cache)" as Tasks

User --> App : interact (search, start route, submit lost item)
App --> POI : read POIs, write annotations
App --> Mapbox : tiles, geocoding
App --> Session : publish presence / subscribe
App --> Tasks : CRUD tasks

App -> App : Compute route (Dijkstra + hazards)
App -> App : Hazard evaluation (local filter)

note right of App
Core processes: Search, Route Compute,
Hazard Eval, Lost&Found, Task Boards
end note

@enduml
